          players: 'Four players with no fixed partnerships. Each hand, the auction determines a temporary Declarer and Acceptor (dummy); the other two defend. All four score individually over the rubber.',
          deck: 'Standard 52-card French deck. All 52 cards are used; 13 cards are dealt to each of the four players. No jokers.',
          equipment: '',
